  "schema:datePublished": "2024-06-20",
  "schema:description": "AIVA image of four deep trays with Bennu sample removed from the OSIRIS-REx TAGSAM head before the bulk pour. The image shows samples OREX-800010-0 through OREX-800013-0.Advanced Imaging &amp; Visualization of Astromaterials (AIVA) team members are Erika Blumenfeld (Creative Lead), Joseph Aebersold (Project Lead), and Christopher Snead (Civil Servant Lead). Blumenfeld is a Transdisciplinary Artist, Photographer, and Researcher as well as a Conservation &amp; Imaging Specialist. Aebersold is an Image Scientist and 3D Imagery Analyst. Snead is the Deputy Sample Curator of OSIRIS-REx, as well as the Hayabusa2 Sample Curator and the Small Particle Lead.",
